---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---
<Site active="how-it-works">
  <section class="hero-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0px, 1fr); align-items: stretch; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); background: linear-gradient(rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.09), rgb(255, 255, 255));">
    <div class="hero-copy" style="display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: clamp(46px, 6vw, 86px) 24px;">
      <div style="width: 100%; max-width: 860px;">
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 24px;">How Clairo works</div>
        <h1 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(33px, 4.3vw, 48px); line-height: 1.07; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.036em; color: var(--clairo-navy); max-width: 19ch;">More choice doesn't have to mean more work.</h1>
        <p style="margin: 20px 0px 0px; font-size: 18.5px; line-height: 29px; font-weight: 650; color: var(--clairo-blue); max-width: 48ch;">You stay involved in who provides care. We carry the administration behind it.</p>
        <p style="margin: 16px 0px 0px; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 26px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 54ch;">Clairo is a Maryland DDA provider agency. That means the employment, payroll, training, billing, and compliance for services we deliver sit with us — while families and participants stay at the center of building the care team.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions" style="display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/contact"><Button size="lg">Talk to Clairo</Button></a>
          <a href="/contact"><Button size="lg" variant="outline">Start a conversation</Button></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--background); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px);">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0px auto;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">The process</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">Six steps, and we do most of the lifting.</h2>
        <p class="clairo-body" style="max-width: 64ch; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">Every family moves at a different speed. Nothing here has to happen all at once.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 38px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;">
        <div class="clairo-card two-col" style="padding: 26px 28px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr 190px; gap: 24px; align-items: center;">
          <div style="width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clairo-blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">1</div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Start with a conversation</p>
            <p style="margin: 7px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 76ch;">Tell us about the participant, current services, the care team, and what isn't working. No forms first — a conversation.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700;">About 30 minutes</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card two-col" style="padding: 26px 28px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr 190px; gap: 24px; align-items: center;">
          <div style="width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clairo-blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">2</div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Review services and authorizations</p>
            <p style="margin: 7px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 76ch;">We look at the participant's plan, approved services, and authorizations to see which services Clairo may be able to deliver.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700;">With your CCS as needed</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card two-col" style="padding: 26px 28px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr 190px; gap: 24px; align-items: center;">
          <div style="width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clairo-blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">3</div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Build the care team</p>
            <p style="margin: 7px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 76ch;">Decide together who should be providing support — including caregivers the participant already knows and qualified family or friends where permitted.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700;">You stay in the decisions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card two-col" style="padding: 26px 28px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr 190px; gap: 24px; align-items: center;">
          <div style="width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clairo-blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">4</div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Onboard caregivers</p>
            <p style="margin: 7px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 76ch;">Applications, background checks, required training, and account setup. Clairo runs the process and keeps everyone updated.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700;">About a week</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card two-col" style="padding: 26px 28px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr 190px; gap: 24px; align-items: center;">
          <div style="width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clairo-blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">5</div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Coordinate the transition</p>
            <p style="margin: 7px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 76ch;">We work with the participant, family, and coordinator so services and schedules move over without gaps.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700;">At your pace</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="clairo-card two-col" style="padding: 26px 28px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr 190px; gap: 24px; align-items: center;">
          <div style="width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clairo-blue); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">6</div>
          <div>
            <p style="margin: 0px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--clairo-navy);">Start services</p>
            <p style="margin: 7px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 76ch;">Care begins. Daily notes, schedules, and records live in one app so the whole team stays connected.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(86, 174, 245, 0.1); color: rgb(10, 94, 164); font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700;">Ongoing support</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section id="bring" style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell two-col" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center;">
      <div>
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow">Bringing your caregiver</p>
        <h2 class="clairo-h2">What happens to the people already providing care.</h2>
        <p class="clairo-body">This is the question families ask first. In many cases a caregiver the participant already trusts can apply to work through Clairo and keep providing support.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 13px; margin-top: 22px;">
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Your caregiver applies as a Clairo employee</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">We run background checks, training, and onboarding</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Clairo becomes the employer of record for services we deliver</span></div>
          <div class="clairo-check"><svg fill="none" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px;">Qualified family and friends may be eligible where DDA rules permit</span></div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin: 20px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 20px; color: var(--muted-foreground); max-width: 62ch;">Subject to service requirements, caregiver qualifications, onboarding, DDA rules, and the participant's individual circumstances.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="clairo-card" style="padding: 30px; background: var(--background);">
        <p style="margin: 0px 0px 18px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.055em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-blue);">What Clairo handles</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="padding: 12px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: center;"><span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex;"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--foreground);">Applications and background checks</span></div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: center;"><span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex;"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--foreground);">Required training and certifications</span></div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: center;"><span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex;"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--foreground);">Payroll, taxes, and pay schedules</span></div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: center;"><span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex;"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--foreground);">Timekeeping and EVV</span></div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: center;"><span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex;"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--foreground);">Billing to Medicaid</span></div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: center;"><span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex;"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--foreground);">Compliance and documentation</span></div>
          <div style="padding: 12px 0px; display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: center;"><span style="color: var(--clairo-blue); flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex;"><svg fill="none" height="15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--foreground);">Ongoing coordinator support</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="background: var(--clairo-navy); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div class="clairo-shell" style="padding-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px); padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px);">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0px auto;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Where are you starting from?</p>
        <h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.3vw, 36px); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">The first step looks a little different depending on your model.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 18px; margin-top: 36px;">
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 30px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.055em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Coming from traditional services?</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">We start with who you want on the care team.</h3>
          <p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Most of the conversation is about caregiver choice, retention, and whether someone the participant already knows could take on the role.</p>
          <a href="/traditional-services" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Traditional services →</a>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); padding: 30px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);">
          <p style="margin: 0px 0px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.055em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Currently self-directing?</p>
          <h3 style="margin: 0px; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">We start with your services and authorizations.</h3>
          <p style="margin: 12px 0px 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">We look at which services Clairo may be able to deliver, and what could stay self-directed — then talk through the trade-offs honestly.</p>
          <a href="/self-directed-services" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750; color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Self-Directed Services →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section style="padding: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px) 24px 30px; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
    <div style="max-width: 1104px; margin: 0px auto; background: var(--clairo-navy); border-radius: var(--radius-2xl); padding: clamp(34px, 5vw, 58px); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <div style="max-width: 700px;">
        <p class="clairo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--clairo-light-blue);">Let's talk</p>
        <h2 style="margin: 0px; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 38px); line-height: 1.14; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Ready to see what the first step looks like?</h2>
        <p style="margin: 14px 0px 0px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 25px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">Tell us where you're starting from and we'll map out the process for your family's situation.</p>
        <p style="margin: 10px 0px 0px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-on-navy-soft);">No pressure. Just a conversation about your options.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><Button size="lg">Talk to Clairo</Button></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  </Site>
